# Stations PDF (current)

Single button: **Export Stations PDF** on Portfolio → Stations (`exportPortfolioStationsPdf` in `build-unified-v2.cjs`).

## Screen (Stations tab)

**Overview** = compare bar chart + station chips + hour×day×location table with a bordered **AVG** banner (week overall + per location).

## PDF structure

1. **Stations Analysis** — full-page items/staff-hr bar chart (captured via off-DOM canvas so page 1 is never blank).
2. **Per station** — white **title divider** (dark RDG logo, navy pill, navy footer).
3. **Day × location table** (large): Mon…Sun + Week · Ful · Items/staff-hr · Items/person · all 5 locations.
4. **Hour × day × location table** (large) with bordered **AVG** banner on top (overall week AVG + CL/CN/ACG/AWP/MILA).

Do **not** emit former “Portfolio - Stations 1-3 / 7-8” multi-family pages.

## Logo assets

- Processed: `assets/rdg-logo-light.png` / `assets/rdg-logo-dark.png`.
- Rebuild embeds base64 via `RDG_LOGO_LIGHT_DATA_URL` / `RDG_LOGO_DARK_DATA_URL`.
